ISO-10303-21;
/* Fi001: two-faced OPEN_SHELL sharing a spine EDGE_CURVE; face A has plane tilted up (convex side, ~120 deg dihedral); face B has plane tilted down at inflection vertex (concave side, ~60 deg dihedral); fillet surface twists across the concavity-flip inflection point; fillet must be rejected or split at inflection vertex */
